{"title": "J&K Violence: Homes Demolished, Hundreds Detained After Police Killing", "summary": "Following the killing of a police official in Anantnag, Jammu and Kashmir, authorities demolished the homes of two suspected militants. In response to the incident, security forces also detained approximately 2,500 individuals. Hundreds of people attended the funeral of the slain police officer, underscoring the impact of the violence.", "summary_points": ["A police official was killed in an incident in Anantnag, Jammu and Kashmir.", "Authorities demolished the homes of two individuals suspected of militant involvement.", "Security forces detained around 2,500 people in the aftermath.", "Hundreds attended the funeral of the deceased police official."], "title_hi": "जम्मू-कश्मीर हिंसा: पुलिसकर्मी की हत्या के बाद घर गिराए गए, सैकड़ों हिरासत में", "summary_hi": "अनंतनाग में एक पुलिस अधिकारी की हत्या के बाद, अधिकारियों ने दो संदिग्ध आतंकवादियों के घरों को ध्वस्त कर दिया। घटना के जवाब में, सुरक्षा बलों ने लगभग 2,500 लोगों को हिरासत में भी लिया। मारे गए पुलिस अधिकारी के अंतिम संस्कार में सैकड़ों लोग शामिल हुए, जो हिंसा के प्रभाव को रेखांकित करता है।", "summary_points_hi": ["जम्मू और कश्मीर के अनंतनाग में एक पुलिस अधिकारी की हत्या कर दी गई।", "अधिकारियों ने आतंकवादी गतिविधियों में संलिप्तता के संदेह में दो व्यक्तियों के घरों को ध्वस्त कर दिया।", "सुरक्षा बलों ने घटना के बाद लगभग 2,500 लोगों को हिरासत में लिया।", "मृत पुलिस अधिकारी के अंतिम संस्कार में सैकड़ों लोग शामिल हुए।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning coverage focuses on the demolition of homes of suspected militants following the killing of a policeman.", "center": "Centrist coverage highlights the attendance of hundreds at the funeral of the J&K police official killed in the attack.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets emphasize the scale of the crackdown, noting the detention of 2,500 individuals after the policeman's death."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "वाम-झुकाव वाली कवरेज में पुलिसकर्मी की हत्या के बाद संदिग्ध आतंकवादियों के घरों को गिराए जाने पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया गया है।", "center": "मध्यमार्गी कवरेज में हमले में मारे गए जम्मू-कश्मीर पुलिस अधिकारी के अंतिम संस्कार में सैकड़ों लोगों की उपस्थिति पर प्रकाश डाला गया है।", "right": "दक्षिणपंथी आउटलेट पुलिसकर्मी की मौत के बाद 2,500 लोगों की हिरासत में लिए जाने का उल्लेख करते हुए, कार्रवाई के पैमाने पर जोर देते हैं।"}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://c.ndtvimg.com/2026-07/6s7smqf4_anantnag-encounter-_650x400_22_July_26.jpg?im=FeatureCrop,algorithm=dnn,width=1280,height=720", "sources": [{"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/over-2-000-detained-across-j-k-after-cop-killed-in-anantnag-terrorist-attack-11808147", "headline": "Over 2,000 Detained Across J&K After Cop Killed In Anantnag Terrorist Attack"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/nearly-700-detained-as-j-k-police-launch-security-sweep-11807461", "headline": "Nearly 700 Detained As J&K Police Launch Security Sweep"}, {"source": "Scroll.in", "owner": "Scroll.in", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Jammu and Kashmir: Policeman killed in suspected terror attack"}, {"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Anantnag Terror Attack: J&K Police Launch Massive Valley-Wide Crackdown, Around 1,000 Detained"}, {"source": "National Herald", "owner": "National Herald", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Modiji, nation is not your father’s: Kejriwal likens Modi to Gen Dyer"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/2-terrorists-family-homes-demolished-in-kashmir-day-after-anantnag-terror-attack-11810272", "headline": "2 Terrorists' Family Homes Demolish